WEBVTT

00:00:02.480 --> 00:00:03.940
<i>Twenty-five years ago,</i>

00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:10.100
<i>massive creatures emerged into 
the world without warning.</i>

00:00:10.900 --> 00:00:14.760
<i>Simply by moving, they caused enormous damage.</i>

00:00:15.740 --> 00:00:19.620
<i>The Dragons are nothing but huge.</i>

00:00:21.760 --> 00:00:27.770
<i>Defying all common sense, these monsters 
vanished as quickly as they appeared.</i>

00:00:28.890 --> 00:00:35.130
<i>Since then, people with the same powers 
as the Dragons have come to be born.</i>

00:00:39.080 --> 00:00:40.690
<i>And three years ago...</i>

00:01:24.020 --> 00:01:26.180
<i>This place is like a dream.</i>

00:01:29.850 --> 00:01:32.860
<i>Those who possess the same 
powers as the Dragons</i>

00:01:32.860 --> 00:01:37.990
<i>are called Type Dragons, or D.</i>

00:01:53.750 --> 00:02:00.050
<b><i>Unlimited Fafnir</i></b>

00:03:08.330 --> 00:03:11.710
<b>Midgar of Ryuuen</b>

00:03:09.750 --> 00:03:12.070
Why is there a man here?

00:03:12.070 --> 00:03:13.790
Well, I...

00:03:13.790 --> 00:03:14.990
Kerykeion!

00:03:19.550 --> 00:03:21.720
I can fight, too, you know.

00:03:21.720 --> 00:03:24.200
I can handle one intruder.

00:03:24.200 --> 00:03:26.010
Wait! Calm down.

00:03:26.010 --> 00:03:28.930
From afar I summon thee, Seigin.

00:03:37.200 --> 00:03:38.380
Hey, now...

00:03:47.970 --> 00:03:49.660
<i>She's pretty.</i>

00:03:53.540 --> 00:03:55.080
H-Hang on!

00:03:55.080 --> 00:03:57.480
Let go, molester! Pervert!

00:03:57.480 --> 00:03:59.890
I'm neither a molester nor a pervert!

00:03:59.890 --> 00:04:01.050
You're not fooling me.

00:04:01.050 --> 00:04:03.600
There aren't supposed to be 
any men on Midgar.

00:04:03.600 --> 00:04:05.090
I was brought here.

00:04:05.420 --> 00:04:07.600
I got stuffed into a NIFL container.

00:04:08.050 --> 00:04:10.770
NIFL? A soldier?

00:04:10.770 --> 00:04:13.390
Yeah, my name's Mononobe Yuu.

00:04:13.620 --> 00:04:15.420
Mononobe Yuu...

00:04:15.420 --> 00:04:17.060
I'm sixteen years old.

00:04:17.060 --> 00:04:18.610
That's the same as me.

00:04:19.810 --> 00:04:23.310
So, why is there a soldier here?

00:04:23.310 --> 00:04:25.190
Put that on first.

00:04:25.190 --> 00:04:26.330
R-Right...

00:04:28.570 --> 00:04:30.540
What's your name?

00:04:30.950 --> 00:04:31.890
Iris.

00:04:32.560 --> 00:04:34.250
Iris Freyja.

00:04:34.790 --> 00:04:36.200
Sorry about that.

00:04:36.200 --> 00:04:38.670
It was to stop you from attacking me, but...

00:04:39.720 --> 00:04:40.970
Seriously.

00:04:41.560 --> 00:04:43.510
I thought you were going 
to do something perverted.

00:04:43.510 --> 00:04:44.760
I wouldn't!

00:04:44.760 --> 00:04:46.730
Why are you naked, anyway?

00:04:46.730 --> 00:04:47.180
Hm?

00:04:47.400 --> 00:04:52.010
A-Anyway, put your own clothes on 
and give me back my shirt.

00:04:52.010 --> 00:04:54.170
What? But I already put it on!

00:04:54.170 --> 00:04:54.890
No way.

00:04:55.520 --> 00:04:57.920
You're going to sniff it and lick it.

00:04:57.920 --> 00:04:58.860
I'm not!

00:04:58.860 --> 00:05:00.100
Mononobe, molester!

00:05:00.100 --> 00:05:01.360
Mononobe, pervert!

00:05:01.360 --> 00:05:02.940
Molester! Pervert!

00:05:01.830 --> 00:05:02.940
Iris-san,

00:05:03.210 --> 00:05:07.610
could you please not use a person's last 
name to call them a molester or pervert?

00:05:07.610 --> 00:05:10.950
Oh, right, your last name's 
also Mononobe, Mitsuki-chan.

00:05:11.300 --> 00:05:12.850
It's been three years,

00:05:14.530 --> 00:05:15.370
Nii-san.

00:05:21.220 --> 00:05:22.460
Join the school?

00:05:22.460 --> 00:05:23.530
Yes.

00:05:24.170 --> 00:05:27.070
I thought Midgar was only for girls.

00:05:27.070 --> 00:05:29.870
Here. It's your uniform.

00:05:29.870 --> 00:05:31.770
I'll fill you in on the details later.

00:05:32.580 --> 00:05:35.650
We can't have you dressed 
so indecently forever.

00:05:43.170 --> 00:05:44.240
So it's you.

00:05:44.870 --> 00:05:47.690
The first male student since 
the academy was founded.

00:05:48.360 --> 00:05:49.930
Mononobe Yuu.

00:05:49.930 --> 00:05:51.830
Yeah... Yes.

00:05:52.120 --> 00:05:53.980
My name is Shinomiya Haruka.

00:05:53.980 --> 00:05:57.920
I'm in charge of the Brynhildr 
class, and I teach.

00:05:58.200 --> 00:06:01.340
My rank is colonel. 
I'm in command here at Midgar.

00:06:01.730 --> 00:06:03.840
Forgive my rudeness, Colonel.

00:06:04.220 --> 00:06:06.650
Please don't call me Colonel at school.

00:06:06.650 --> 00:06:08.760
I heard you were exemplary at NIFL.

00:06:09.940 --> 00:06:12.600
Let's confirm how knowledgeable you are.

00:06:12.890 --> 00:06:16.850
Do you know why this Midgar exists?

00:06:17.200 --> 00:06:21.620
I'm told that it was initially a 
quarantine zone for Ds captured by NIFL.

00:06:21.620 --> 00:06:25.600
However, since Ds are now recognized, 
internationally, as having human rights,

00:06:25.600 --> 00:06:27.150
it broke away from NIFL

00:06:27.150 --> 00:06:29.700
and joined Asgard to become an 
autonomous educational facility.

00:06:30.160 --> 00:06:32.920
And what are its current activities?

00:06:32.920 --> 00:06:36.620
To promote the use of the Ds' 
powers for the good of society.

00:06:37.080 --> 00:06:41.170
It educates its students on the conversion 
of dark matter into rare resources,

00:06:41.170 --> 00:06:45.590
as well as on becoming the ultimate 
weapons in the fight against the Dragons.

00:06:46.210 --> 00:06:48.640
I'd grade that at about forty percent.

00:06:48.640 --> 00:06:51.990
Midgar's most important role is elsewhere.

00:06:52.610 --> 00:06:54.520
Although it's not made public.

00:06:55.370 --> 00:06:58.980
There's no doubt they'll target this place someday.

00:06:59.490 --> 00:07:00.740
There's no doubt.

00:07:02.340 --> 00:07:06.190
I didn't think I'd be transferred to the academy.

00:07:06.810 --> 00:07:09.100
I thought I'd be on coast guard 
service or something.

00:07:09.100 --> 00:07:11.940
The Midgardsormr are 
adequate for guard service.

00:07:12.420 --> 00:07:16.740
Besides, Nii-san, you meet the requirements 
for attending this academy.

00:07:16.740 --> 00:07:18.510
Because I'm a D?

00:07:18.510 --> 00:07:19.130
Yes.

00:07:19.610 --> 00:07:21.670
A school-wide assembly is about to begin.

00:07:22.110 --> 00:07:24.330
I'm going to introduce you to everyone there.

00:07:24.330 --> 00:07:25.400
Introduce me?

00:07:25.400 --> 00:07:26.660
You are?

00:07:26.660 --> 00:07:29.090
Yes. I'm the student body president.

00:07:29.090 --> 00:07:30.130
Wow.

00:07:30.130 --> 00:07:31.310
A male D?

00:07:31.310 --> 00:07:32.090
Really?

00:07:32.090 --> 00:07:34.540
He's a D first and a man second.

00:07:34.540 --> 00:07:37.560
He's one of our few comrades.

00:07:37.930 --> 00:07:42.020
To accept him as one of our own without 
discriminating against him for his sex

00:07:42.020 --> 00:07:47.910
is proof that we are highly socially-aware 
members of humanity and proud Ds.

00:07:49.020 --> 00:07:50.580
He is my brother,

00:07:50.580 --> 00:07:54.480
therefore I shall punish him all the more 
severely for any problem he may cause.

00:07:54.930 --> 00:07:58.980
So, please, do not worry. Carry on with 
your school activities as usual.

00:07:58.980 --> 00:08:01.800
<i>To say nothing of my own worries, huh?</i>

00:08:01.800 --> 00:08:04.630
Please give my brother a warm welcome.

00:08:07.570 --> 00:08:09.080
My name is Mononobe Yuu.

00:08:09.080 --> 00:08:11.550
I'm inexperienced, but I look 
forward to working with you.

00:08:14.610 --> 00:08:16.840
You can't be inexperienced.

00:08:16.840 --> 00:08:19.690
I told you, what happened 
this morning was a mistake.

00:08:20.130 --> 00:08:21.640
But I'll be careful.

00:08:22.170 --> 00:08:25.100
You'll be in the same class as me.

00:08:25.400 --> 00:08:29.210
There's a special curriculum for 
fighting against the Dragons.

00:08:29.210 --> 00:08:30.470
Work hard.

00:08:30.470 --> 00:08:31.320
Yeah.

00:08:31.850 --> 00:08:34.780
It's difficult, in a lot of ways.

00:08:34.780 --> 00:08:36.680
Here's his formal introduction.

00:08:36.680 --> 00:08:38.220
His name is Mononobe Yuu.

00:08:38.220 --> 00:08:39.710
Nice to meet you.

00:08:41.310 --> 00:08:42.160
Sensei.

00:08:42.700 --> 00:08:44.080
Lisa Highwalker.

00:08:44.580 --> 00:08:46.460
I don't approve.

00:08:46.460 --> 00:08:49.210
We can't have a man in Midgar.

00:08:49.210 --> 00:08:52.090
Isn't this an abuse of authority?

00:08:52.090 --> 00:08:56.430
No, it was decided through formal 
procedures and evaluations.

00:08:56.840 --> 00:08:58.040
That's correct.

00:08:58.040 --> 00:09:02.180
The Ryumon on his left hand is 
unassailable evidence that he's a D.

00:09:02.180 --> 00:09:06.270
Then can we have you show us 
your actual D powers?

00:09:06.710 --> 00:09:08.020
I agree.

00:09:09.000 --> 00:09:09.940
It's a good opportunity.

00:09:10.370 --> 00:09:12.350
I'd like to see, too.

00:09:12.350 --> 00:09:13.510
All right.

00:09:18.070 --> 00:09:21.690
<i>Dark matter is a versatile 
factor that can be converted</i>

00:09:21.690 --> 00:09:23.830
<i>into any material or phenomenon in the world.</i>

00:09:24.290 --> 00:09:28.160
<i>Being able to create it 
is evidence that I am a D.</i>

00:09:28.160 --> 00:09:29.290
AT Nergal.

00:09:34.810 --> 00:09:37.590
Mononobe, is that a gun?

00:09:37.590 --> 00:09:38.800
Yeah.

00:09:38.800 --> 00:09:40.390
It can fire live bullets.

00:09:40.390 --> 00:09:42.600
I get that you can produce dark matter.

00:09:42.930 --> 00:09:46.130
But why did you waste it on that?

00:09:46.130 --> 00:09:47.610
Waste?

00:09:47.610 --> 00:09:49.470
This isn't NIFL.

00:09:49.470 --> 00:09:51.020
Your enemies aren't human.

00:09:51.440 --> 00:09:55.710
Lisa, list all of the 
Dragons confirmed to date.

00:09:55.710 --> 00:09:56.280
Yes.

00:09:56.600 --> 00:10:00.360
The first one that appeared 25 
years ago was the Black Vritra.

00:10:00.360 --> 00:10:04.780
The White Leviathan, the Red 
Basilisk, the Blue Hecatoncheir,

00:10:04.780 --> 00:10:07.980
the Yellow Hraesvelgr, 
the Green Yggdrasil,

00:10:07.980 --> 00:10:12.540
and the Purple Kraken, which was 
defeated two years ago. Seven in all.

00:10:13.480 --> 00:10:17.470
Then what is the Dragon we are 
currently planning to defeat?

00:10:17.470 --> 00:10:18.790
Iris Freyja.

00:10:18.790 --> 00:10:20.090
R-Right!

00:10:20.090 --> 00:10:22.010
The Red Basilisk.

00:10:22.010 --> 00:10:25.740
The Basilisk wears diamond scales.

00:10:25.740 --> 00:10:28.950
What do you hope to accomplish with that gun?

00:10:28.950 --> 00:10:30.310
I'm sorry.

00:10:31.140 --> 00:10:35.490
Mitsuki-san, your brother 
really isn't much, is he?

00:10:35.490 --> 00:10:39.780
But I think Nii-san has proven that he's a D.

00:10:39.780 --> 00:10:44.020
Th-That's right. I'm surprised 
a man can be a D, too.

00:10:44.020 --> 00:10:45.330
Right, Mononobe?

00:10:45.330 --> 00:10:46.330
Iris-san.

00:10:46.590 --> 00:10:47.740
Do you know him?

00:10:47.740 --> 00:10:50.290
I had no idea.

00:10:50.690 --> 00:10:53.710
Mononobe was one of us...

00:10:54.130 --> 00:10:55.430
It doesn't bother me.

00:10:55.430 --> 00:10:56.450
Me, neither.

00:10:56.890 --> 00:10:59.210
I'm not bothered by what 
happened this morning.

00:10:59.210 --> 00:11:01.170
What happened this morning?

00:11:01.960 --> 00:11:03.080
Well...

00:11:03.080 --> 00:11:06.520
I was seen naked, pushed down,

00:11:06.520 --> 00:11:09.240
and nearly had my clothes taken away.

00:11:09.240 --> 00:11:11.140
No, that's...

00:11:11.370 --> 00:11:12.570
Nii-san.

00:11:12.570 --> 00:11:14.240
He's scum.

00:11:16.860 --> 00:11:19.820
That was... That was...

00:11:33.270 --> 00:11:35.430
That's a lifetime's worth of exhaustion.

00:11:35.430 --> 00:11:37.440
Mononobe, what's wrong?

00:11:37.440 --> 00:11:39.300
Whose fault do you think...

00:11:39.610 --> 00:11:40.340
Hm?

00:11:41.230 --> 00:11:42.440
No, nothing.

00:11:42.890 --> 00:11:47.180
Anyway, why did they make an 
exercise room underground?

00:11:47.570 --> 00:11:49.720
To avoid material contamination.

00:11:49.720 --> 00:11:53.620
We could make poison gas 
if we tried, after all.

00:11:53.620 --> 00:11:55.380
We'd do something that dangerous?

00:11:55.380 --> 00:11:57.030
It's just a precaution.

00:11:57.030 --> 00:12:00.530
We might mess up a matter conversion 
and make some by accident.

00:12:00.780 --> 00:12:02.990
Mess up a matter conversion, huh?

00:12:02.990 --> 00:12:04.450
Wh-What?

00:12:04.970 --> 00:12:08.470
Nah, just thinking you'd 
probably be the most at risk,

00:12:08.470 --> 00:12:10.290
having seen the explosion this morning.

00:12:10.290 --> 00:12:12.580
Th-That's not true.

00:12:12.580 --> 00:12:14.890
I'm going to get it right today.

00:12:14.890 --> 00:12:16.900
You mean you've never succeeded before?

00:12:18.620 --> 00:12:19.920
All right, here we go.

00:12:20.150 --> 00:12:21.570
O-Okay...

00:12:22.600 --> 00:12:23.880
Ow, ow.

00:12:23.880 --> 00:12:26.680
You're so stiff.

00:12:26.680 --> 00:12:30.140
No, you're just pushing too hard.

00:12:30.140 --> 00:12:32.380
I'll go slower this time, then.

00:12:36.360 --> 00:12:38.090
I-I can't go any further.

00:12:38.090 --> 00:12:39.220
That's enough.

00:12:39.220 --> 00:12:40.750
We're beginning the drill.

00:12:40.750 --> 00:12:41.400
Huh?

00:12:42.030 --> 00:12:46.070
This is your first time, Nii-san, 
so watch from the other room.

00:12:46.070 --> 00:12:46.990
Sure.

00:12:49.770 --> 00:12:51.160
<i>For the sake of the newcomer,</i>

00:12:51.450 --> 00:12:53.870
we're going to mix in some review.

00:12:54.230 --> 00:12:57.510
<i>What's the most versatile matter exchange?</i>

00:12:57.510 --> 00:12:59.020
<i>Lisa Highwalker?</i>

00:12:59.020 --> 00:12:59.840
Air.

00:13:03.260 --> 00:13:04.500
She's flying.

00:13:04.500 --> 00:13:07.080
Exchanging to air generates wind.

00:13:07.080 --> 00:13:09.100
If you can control it, you can fly.

00:13:09.460 --> 00:13:11.060
Basics.

00:13:11.480 --> 00:13:14.680
<i>Now then, commence the Basilisk combat drill.</i>

00:13:20.570 --> 00:13:23.070
So much matter conversion.

00:13:23.380 --> 00:13:24.560
It's diamond.

00:13:25.480 --> 00:13:27.280
<i>Watch carefully, Mononobe Yuu.</i>

00:13:27.620 --> 00:13:30.610
I'll show you the difference between us.

00:13:31.940 --> 00:13:33.080
Gungnir.

00:13:50.810 --> 00:13:52.130
What's the spear for?

00:13:52.130 --> 00:13:55.860
It's difficult to get a clear image when you 
go straight to a dark matter conversion,

00:13:55.860 --> 00:13:58.500
and that can lead to unexpected conversions.

00:13:58.500 --> 00:14:02.100
You converted dark matter 
directly into a gun,

00:14:02.100 --> 00:14:04.700
but that's normally considered improper.

00:14:05.110 --> 00:14:08.560
Is that spear not materialized yet?

00:14:08.560 --> 00:14:12.580
Its form has been changed, so its 
surface is slightly materialized.

00:14:12.580 --> 00:14:16.160
But 99% of it is still dark matter.

00:14:16.670 --> 00:14:17.690
Pierce!

00:14:18.160 --> 00:14:19.620
Flare!

00:14:27.370 --> 00:14:28.310
The diamond...

00:14:28.310 --> 00:14:31.930
Swords slash, spears pierce, bows are shot.

00:14:32.170 --> 00:14:37.150
Matter converted while 
picturing a weapon in use

00:14:37.390 --> 00:14:40.200
automatically becomes 
the force of the attack.

00:14:40.970 --> 00:14:43.060
<i>Next, Firill Crest.</i>

00:14:43.480 --> 00:14:45.650
Come, Necronomicon.

00:15:03.740 --> 00:15:05.710
Aero Blast Quartet!

00:15:12.090 --> 00:15:15.030
It's a cannonball made of air that's 
been compressed to the extreme.

00:15:15.780 --> 00:15:18.770
Have you noticed something, Mononobe Yuu?

00:15:19.000 --> 00:15:23.170
The girls aren't picturing actual bullets 
in any of their matter conversions.

00:15:23.170 --> 00:15:25.710
All they picture is magic.

00:15:25.710 --> 00:15:26.940
Magic?

00:15:27.850 --> 00:15:31.250
Women have impressive imaginations.

00:15:32.630 --> 00:15:34.320
<i>Next, Ren Miyazawa.</i>

00:15:40.210 --> 00:15:41.290
Mjölnir.

00:15:52.950 --> 00:15:53.760
Wind!

00:15:55.370 --> 00:15:56.720
<i>Ariella Lu.</i>

00:15:57.930 --> 00:15:58.980
Aegis.

00:16:12.530 --> 00:16:14.170
Deploy barrier!

00:16:22.720 --> 00:16:24.130
<i>Mononobe Mitsuki.</i>

00:16:27.100 --> 00:16:28.140
Brionac.

00:16:41.360 --> 00:16:44.020
First Arrow: Folk Wind!

00:16:53.280 --> 00:16:57.410
This is how the girls prepare 
for battle with the Dragons.

00:16:57.410 --> 00:16:58.960
And for their own self-defense.

00:16:58.960 --> 00:16:59.730
Hm?

00:16:59.730 --> 00:17:04.080
Do you know why the Dragons appeared 
all over the world at once?

00:17:04.370 --> 00:17:05.110
No.

00:17:06.120 --> 00:17:07.310
They're pairs.

00:17:07.310 --> 00:17:08.250
Pairs?

00:17:08.480 --> 00:17:12.190
Each Dragon is searching for its matching D.

00:17:12.190 --> 00:17:14.110
The Ds have Ryumons, yes?

00:17:14.110 --> 00:17:14.870
Yes.

00:17:15.290 --> 00:17:18.660
Those who have attracted 
a Dragon change color.

00:17:18.660 --> 00:17:21.580
And if the D comes in 
contact with that Dragon,

00:17:21.580 --> 00:17:23.600
they will be transformed into 
the same kind of Dragon.

00:17:23.600 --> 00:17:25.140
That's impossible.

00:17:25.360 --> 00:17:27.100
A D becomes a Dragon?

00:17:27.100 --> 00:17:31.620
This is a fact that was confirmed during 
a battle with the Purple Kraken.

00:17:32.100 --> 00:17:36.320
We took down two Krakens two years ago.

00:17:36.580 --> 00:17:40.900
<i>Does she mean they killed a comrade 
who had become a Dragon?</i>

00:17:42.290 --> 00:17:46.370
Since then, Midgar's role has 
undergone a fundamental change.

00:17:46.810 --> 00:17:48.990
It became a fortress for 
protecting attracting Ds,

00:17:48.990 --> 00:17:54.300
and for intercepting Dragons 
deprived of their mates.

00:17:54.700 --> 00:17:57.300
<i>I'm going to get it right today.</i>

00:18:00.620 --> 00:18:01.920
Caduceus!

00:18:16.890 --> 00:18:20.280
Come, come, distant fragment.

00:18:21.490 --> 00:18:25.950
Come, come, distant fragment.

00:18:27.230 --> 00:18:30.210
Seigin! Emerge!

00:18:32.440 --> 00:18:33.750
Wind!

00:18:39.570 --> 00:18:41.090
Thanks, Lisa-chan.

00:18:41.090 --> 00:18:42.210
Sheesh.

00:18:42.950 --> 00:18:44.810
You're helpless.

00:18:45.850 --> 00:18:47.390
She failed again.

00:18:48.520 --> 00:18:50.600
One more time, please.

00:18:51.810 --> 00:18:54.000
At least she tries.

00:18:54.000 --> 00:18:54.570
Yeah.

00:18:54.570 --> 00:18:56.940
<i>One more time, please.</i>

00:19:06.070 --> 00:19:06.730
Hey.

00:19:07.640 --> 00:19:10.720
I'm going to get it right tomorrow for sure.

00:19:10.720 --> 00:19:12.630
You're going to fail again.

00:19:12.630 --> 00:19:14.510
You don't have to be so blunt.

00:19:14.510 --> 00:19:18.090
You're supposed to cheer 
me up at a time like this.

00:19:18.340 --> 00:19:21.600
I could give you baseless hope 
through empty encouragement,

00:19:21.600 --> 00:19:23.930
but you'd just make the same mistake again.

00:19:24.930 --> 00:19:27.720
You won't live long if you 
don't own up to your failures.

00:19:28.680 --> 00:19:31.070
O-Own up to my failures...

00:19:31.070 --> 00:19:34.150
You probably thought you could 
do it if you tried hard enough, right?

00:19:34.630 --> 00:19:36.150
How could you tell?

00:19:36.370 --> 00:19:38.130
Anyone could tell.

00:19:38.130 --> 00:19:39.500
I guess.

00:19:39.500 --> 00:19:41.680
Just trying hard isn't enough.

00:19:41.680 --> 00:19:43.360
Why are you working so hard?

00:19:43.610 --> 00:19:46.180
Because I...

00:19:48.680 --> 00:19:53.120
I used to live on the outside, 
like normal, until a year ago.

00:19:53.330 --> 00:19:56.200
But while I was on a boat with my parents,

00:19:56.200 --> 00:20:01.040
a White Leviathan passed 
by, and the boat sank.

00:20:01.040 --> 00:20:02.250
A Dragon disaster.

00:20:02.250 --> 00:20:03.130
Yeah.

00:20:03.460 --> 00:20:05.700
They all died in that Dragon disaster.

00:20:05.700 --> 00:20:10.730
That's when my powers first 
awoke, and I survived.

00:20:10.730 --> 00:20:13.890
So you're here to get revenge on the Dragons?

00:20:13.890 --> 00:20:15.100
No.

00:20:15.850 --> 00:20:20.410
I don't have any complicated 
feelings, like hatred, in me.

00:20:20.410 --> 00:20:23.070
But I just feel like I need to fight.

00:20:23.540 --> 00:20:25.690
I think that's why I survived.

00:20:27.320 --> 00:20:28.030
I see.

00:20:29.490 --> 00:20:32.400
Sorry... You don't like that sort of thing, right?

00:20:32.400 --> 00:20:33.950
Y-Yeah...

00:20:35.410 --> 00:20:38.370
By the way, why were you naked earlier?

00:20:38.890 --> 00:20:44.010
My swimsuit got swept away by the waves.

00:20:44.650 --> 00:20:47.110
You really are clumsy, Iris.

00:20:47.110 --> 00:20:48.310
You're so mean.

00:20:49.360 --> 00:20:53.140
Why do you care about me, Mononobe?

00:20:53.140 --> 00:20:53.740
Hm?

00:20:54.280 --> 00:20:56.230
The people in class are nice to me, too,

00:20:56.690 --> 00:21:00.870
but you're the first one who's been this nice.

00:21:00.870 --> 00:21:05.530
So I want to know how you feel.

00:21:07.370 --> 00:21:11.910
That's probably because you're 
like Mitsuki when she was younger.

00:21:12.260 --> 00:21:15.060
I'm nothing like Mitsuki-chan.

00:21:15.570 --> 00:21:18.130
She used to resemble you in some ways.

00:21:18.370 --> 00:21:22.240
She still is, but she used 
to be hard-working, like you.

00:21:22.240 --> 00:21:24.280
I think that's why I can't just leave you.

00:21:25.330 --> 00:21:26.420
I see.

00:21:26.980 --> 00:21:28.050
That's a bit disappointing.

00:21:28.300 --> 00:21:28.890
Hm?

00:21:29.300 --> 00:21:30.810
But it doesn't matter.

00:21:30.810 --> 00:21:33.090
I just have to try hard going forward.

00:21:33.860 --> 00:21:34.620
Mononobe.

00:21:34.620 --> 00:21:36.020
What?

00:21:36.330 --> 00:21:40.600
I want to get to know you better.

00:21:40.600 --> 00:21:43.410
S-So if it's okay with you...

00:21:44.970 --> 00:21:47.230
<i>Emergency alert. Emergency alert.</i>

00:21:47.230 --> 00:21:48.700
<i>Alert Level C.</i>

00:21:48.700 --> 00:21:49.980
<i>Type White.</i>

00:21:49.980 --> 00:21:51.070
<i>Repeat.</i>

00:21:51.070 --> 00:21:52.500
<i>Alert Level C.</i>

00:21:52.500 --> 00:21:53.490
<i>Type White.</i>

00:21:53.490 --> 00:21:55.460
Is Level C bad?

00:21:55.870 --> 00:21:56.810
Iris?

00:21:57.230 --> 00:21:58.550
It's nothing.

00:21:58.550 --> 00:22:01.050
Level C happens sometimes.

00:23:39.810 --> 00:24:09.710
<b>Next Episode</b>

00:23:40.780 --> 00:23:42.230
My Ryumon feels hot.

00:23:42.500 --> 00:23:45.090
Am I attracting the Leviathan?

00:23:45.090 --> 00:23:49.490
If they get past the final line of 
defense, I'm going to end up a Dragon.

00:23:49.940 --> 00:23:52.060
Then everyone's going to...

00:23:52.060 --> 00:23:53.410
No way.

00:23:53.410 --> 00:23:54.820
I really don't want that.

00:23:55.880 --> 00:23:57.980
I'm not going to become a Dragon?

00:23:57.980 --> 00:23:59.080
Really?

00:23:59.080 --> 00:24:00.280
Can I believe you?

00:24:01.050 --> 00:24:05.880
Next time on <i>Unlimited Fafnir</i>: 
"White Leviathan."

00:24:05.880 --> 00:24:08.630
Mononobe, will you stay with me?

00:24:09.710 --> 00:24:20.500
<b>Illustration: Imigimuru</b>
